{
 "_doc": [
  "FF6 SNES character sprites -> the PR's frames (tools/snes_charsprites.py; MODDING.md 'SNES character sprites').",
  "poses: SNES poses (tile numbers into a character sheet, w tiles across; 0-39 = the ROM's table at C0/CE3A, 40 dead lying, 46/47 riding).",
  "frames: PR frame name -> {pose, mirror, dy (raised px), shadow [x0, x1) a line of palette index 1 on the bottom row}.",
  "slots: SNES sprite slot (0x150000 sheets) -> the PR's art groups (battle bc_, field mo_ (same pixels, an atlas), face fa_, also: palette variants / Terra's trance), its SNES palette index and portrait id.",
  "groups: frame names per PR battle group (from the game). palettes: per PR group, its SNES palette index (0-7).",
  "color_slots: per PR group, {n: its number of distinct colors, slots: the SNES palette index of each, colors sorted} (build: aligned frames); color_slots_rc: the same on Beyond Chaos' re-indexed Cyan/Mog/Umaro sheets. No colors: snes_charsprites.ColorMaps pairs them with the player's own frames.",
  "portraits: SNES portrait id (0x2D1D00 + id*0x320) -> the PR face group drawn from it."
 ],
